{"version":1,"key":"card:599","content":{"id":599,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"tsd 是什么，它是一个可以让你为类型写测试的工具，一般我们会在 .d.ts 中定义类型，tsd 通过指定的类型测试文件来验证类型定义的正确性，一般是在 .test-d.ts 中文件编写测试代码。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"安装"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"npm install --save-dev tsd","language":"Bash","uuid":"ce767d9a-b304-4e1d-ad68-9b0d9c6f463e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"[npx] tsd [path]","language":"Bash","uuid":"4998d326-f981-4dd0-aab7-ff460b6ac649","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"tsd 会寻找当前或指定目录下的 index.d.ts，然后会测试目录下的 test.d.ts 或者 test-d 子目录。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// index.d.ts\ndeclare const concat: {\n\t(value1: string, value2: string): string;\n\t(value1: number, value2: number): string;\n};\n\nexport default concat;","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"c402b213-c2ae-4a78-b5ed-4dc7967c2458","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// index.test-d.ts\nimport { expectType } from 'tsd';\nimport concat from '.';\n\nexpectType<string>(concat('foo', 'bar'));\nexpectType<string>(concat(1, 2));","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"dcffd59b-9f3d-4d2b-870b-07868fd14875","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"tsd 曾经比较流行，现在倾向于使用 @types 包，以及 TypeScript 自带的类型管理能力。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/tsd","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"tsd"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/工具","TypeScript/tsd"],"createTime":1753055961641,"updateTime":1753144756177,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1753144756177}}